  id: ear_lance
  displayName: Resonant Lance
  description: 'Cut the air and let it sing. A crescent of sound flies from your blade, passing through every foe in its path, and bursts into ringing light where it stops. The Ear mantras are attuned together: they take all three sockets.'
  icon: {fileID: 0}
  iconName: ic_ear_lance
  accent: {r: 0.78, g: 0.62, b: 1, a: 1}
  cooldown: 10
  unlockedAtStart: 0
  setId: ear
  setSlot: 0
  setName: Mantras of the Ear
  setDescription: 'The Precentor heard every bell in the Vale. Now his ears hear for you, and the hymn answers: a crescent of sound that cuts through a line of foes, a sanctuary that throws every shot back at its archer, and a ghostly choir that brings the light down on all who stand in it. Resonant Lance, Sanctuary Bell and Requiem Choir come as one and take all three sockets.'
  damage: 44
  burstDamage: 30
  range: 2.4
  speed: 7
  hitRadius: 0.32
  burstRadius: 0.9
  knockback: 1.2
  windup: 0.12
  castLock: 0.3
  lanceScale: 1.2
  burstScale: 1.15
